                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in Mr. Bingham’s No. 978.—Extract from
                        the Japan Daily Herald, October 6, 1879.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The following is a table of the yearly difference between exports and imports
                    from the 1st to the 11th year of Meiji (1868–78).</p>
                <table cols="3" rows="13">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">Year.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">Exports.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top">Imports.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right"><hi rendition="#italic">Yen.</hi></cell>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Yen.</hi></cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">1st</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">15,553,472 87</cell>
                        <cell role="num">10,693,071 84</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">2d</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">12,908,978 02</cell>
                        <cell role="num">20,783,633 17</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">3d</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">14,543,012 59</cell>
                        <cell role="num">33,741,637 56</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">4th</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">17,968,608 71</cell>
                        <cell role="num">21,916,727 74</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">5th</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">17,026,647 21</cell>
                        <cell role="num">26,174,814 94</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">6th</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">21,142,014 77</cell>
                        <cell role="num">27,617,264 05</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">7th</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">18,780,078 79</cell>
                        <cell role="num">22,924,587 08</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#border-right">8th</cell>
